<h2>Your appointment has changed</h2>
<p>Hi {{ participant_name }},</p>
<p><strong>{{ event_name }}</strong> is now on <strong>{{ start_date }}</strong> from <strong>{{ start_time }}</strong> to <strong>{{ end_time }}</strong>{% if timezone is not empty %} ({{ timezone }}){% endif %}.</p>
{% if event.meeting_link is not empty %}
<p>Join here: <a href="{{ event.meeting_link }}">{{ event.meeting_link }}</a></p>
{% endif %}
<p>If this time doesn't work for you, please get in touch with us.</p>
